    "title_en": "Quantum Approximation and Integration in Sobolev Spaces -- Low Smoothness",
    "abstract_en": "We study the complexity of approximation and integration in Sobolev spaces in the quantum setting of information-based complexity theory (IBC). Previous results have been obtained under the assumption that the embedding condition holds. Here we drop this assumption and use a quantum version of a previously developed stochastic discretization technique.",
